        "description": {
            "value": "<p>To better spread their faith among humans, sekmin Yiggites disguise themselves in these enchanted serpentfolk snakeskins. The snakeskin functions as a set of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Yiggite Preacher Snakeskin]{Moderate Cloister Robes} with the following additional activation.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Change Shape</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span><strong></strong>(concentrate, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You cast a 3rd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Humanoid Form] on yourself. The spell lasts for 8 hours, until you fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Unconscious], or until you Dismiss the effect, whichever comes first.</p><hr /><p>@Embed[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.VMksM7bLAZW9LxH4 inline]</p>"
